{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06073","headline":"和宋中丞夏日游福贤观天长寺寺即陈左相宅所施之作 · 王维","name":"和宋中丞夏日游福贤观天长寺寺即陈左相宅所施之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"已相殷王国，空余尚父谿。\n钓矶开月殿，筑道出云梯。\n积水浮香象，深山鸣白鸡。\n虚空陈伎乐，衣服制虹霓。\n墨点三千界，丹飞六一泥。\n桃源勿遽返，再访恐君迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06073.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06073","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}